<title>RUSSIA: Norilsk says arrears repayment deadline impossible.</title>
<headline>Norilsk says arrears repayment deadline impossible.</headline>
<dateline>MOSCOW 1997-03-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Russia's Norilsk Nickel metals group cannot meet a deadline demanded by labour leaders for payment of salary and holiday arrears, Norilsk group spokesman Sergei Vetchinin told Reuters on Monday.</p>
<p>&quot;The period which the trade union is demanding for repayment is objectively impossible,&quot; he said.</p>
</text>
